@startuml
!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.8  Invoicing & Revenue Billing (QP.51) — Activity
|Originating Dept / Billing|
start
:Job completed / PBC period due;
if (Invoicing stream?) then (PBC)
  :Raise monthly PBC documents by 28th;
  :Attach Sijil Pengesahan + Penalty Weightage
  (35% Availability / 60% Serviceability);
  :Submit to Customer for signature (by month end);
  :Obtain signed set by 2nd; make CTC; submit to HQ by 5th;
elseif (Branch-repaired?) then (yes)
  :Notify Billing on completion (<=3 days) + supporting docs;
  :Raise Tax Invoice + 6% GST (<=3 working days);
  :Submit to Customer; obtain original (<=3 weeks); CTC;
  :Submit 3 sets to HQ (<=7 days);
else (CoE / ACD)
  :Forward docs (AM 75, Analysis, COC/ARC/CRS, label);
  :Raise Tax Invoice + 6% GST, DN, covering letter;
  :7 sets to MRA / key Sales Performance (e-Payment);
endif
|CoE Invoicing|
:Check correctness & completeness;
if (Complete & correct?) then (no)
  :Correct promptly;
  stop
else (yes)
  :Raise / forward Tax Invoice to CPU (Finance);
endif
|Finance & Account|
:Receive & record payment;
:Monitor outstanding payment;
stop
@enduml
